#. (itstool) path: info/desc
#: C/scan-file-system.page:27
msgid "Scan your internal storage devices."
msgstr "Skann dine interne lagringsenheter."

#. (itstool) path: page/title
#: C/scan-file-system.page:31
msgid "Scan the file system"
msgstr "Skann filsystemet"

#. (itstool) path: page/p
#: C/scan-file-system.page:33
msgid ""
"To scan your computer, select the name of your computer from the list of "
"<gui>Devices &amp; Locations</gui>. All of the folders that you have "
"permission to access on your computer will be scanned. It is quite common "
"for you to not have permissions to scan some directories on your computer."
msgstr ""
"For å skanne datamaskinen din, velg navnet på datamaskinen din fra listen "
"over <gui>Enheter &amp; steder</gui>. Alle mappene du har tilgang til på "
"datamaskinen din vil bli skannet. Det er ganske vanlig at du ikke har "
"tilgang til å skanne noen mapper på datamaskinen din."

#. (itstool) path: note/p
#: C/scan-file-system.page:39
msgid ""
"If the file system that you are trying to scan is large, it may take a few "
"minutes for the scan to complete. To cancel the scan, press the button in "
"the top-left corner of the screen to return to the list of devices."
msgstr ""
"Hvis filsystemet du prøver å skanne er stort, kan det ta noen minutter før "
"skanningen er ferdig. For å avbryte skanningen, trykk på knappen i øverste "
"venstre hjørne av skjermen for å gå tilbake til listen over enheter."

#. (itstool) path: info/desc
#: C/scan-folder.page:28
msgid "Scan a local folder, including all subfolders."
msgstr "Skann en lokal mappe, inkludert alle undermapper."

#. (itstool) path: page/title
#: C/scan-folder.page:32
msgid "Scan a folder"
msgstr "Skann en mappe"

#. (itstool) path: page/p
#: C/scan-folder.page:34
msgid ""
"Scans of individual folders are faster than those of the whole file system, "
"so they may be more efficient if you want information only about a specific "
"part of your file system."
msgstr ""
"Skanning av enkeltmapper går raskere enn skanning av hele filsystemet, så "
"det kan være mer effektivt hvis du bare vil ha informasjon om en bestemt del"
" av filsystemet ditt."

#. (itstool) path: item/p
#: C/scan-folder.page:40
msgid ""
"Press the button in the top-right of the main window and select <gui "
"style=\"menuitem\">Scan Folder…</gui>."
msgstr ""
"Trykk på knappen øverst til høyre i hovedvinduet og velg <gui "
"style=\"menuitem\">Skann mappe…</gui>."

#. (itstool) path: item/p
#: C/scan-folder.page:44
msgid ""
"A file chooser dialog will open. Choose the folder which you want to scan."
msgstr "En filvelgerdialog åpnes. Velg mappen du vil skanne."

#. (itstool) path: item/p
#: C/scan-folder.page:48
msgid "Click <gui>Open</gui> to start the scan."
msgstr "Klikk <gui>Åpne</gui> for å starte skanningen."

#. (itstool) path: page/p
#: C/scan-folder.page:52
msgid ""
"The folder which you just scanned will now be added to your list of "
"<gui>Devices &amp; Locations</gui>. If the folder is renamed or deleted, it "
"will be removed from the list when you next restart <app>Disk Usage "
"Analyzer</app>."
msgstr ""
"Mappen du nettopp skannet, vil nå bli lagt til i listen over <gui>Enheter "
